## Decision 07: Atomic Mass Accounting
Problem: `VoxelSphericalCarveJob` read `previous = densityRef` beside `Interlocked.Add`. Under overlapping laser jobs this stale read could over/under-count removed mass and spawn wrong debris counts.
Solution: Use the `Interlocked.Add` return value as truth and derive `previous = next - DeltaDensity`. Mass accounting now matches the exact atomic operation that mutated the accumulator.
Rejected Alternatives: A separate `Interlocked.CompareExchange` loop was rejected as more expensive than needed; the current add result already provides the needed previous value.
Scalability potential: Low/MX350 avoids fake debris over-spawn under multi-hit load. Middle/High/Ultra preserve conservation-of-mass visuals without extra synchronization.
Hardware Impact: No profiler number claimed. It removes a race without adding a second atomic.

